window.products.push({"id":727044,"name":"Swissmar 11-Piece Geneva Stainless Steel Fondue Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619eoZ54uqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Swiss Traditions: As the inspiration behind the Swissmar fondue, the Swiss city of Geneva is rich in Swiss heritage, innovation and quality craftsmanship. Meat fondue originated in France in the middle ages; during the grape harvest, pickers set up pots in the vineyards to cook their meals as it became convenient for them during the day. This ensured a leisurely lunch that could be enjoyed hot and fresh. In later years, meat fondue Beef Bourguignonne was created and became known as the original meat fondue recipe. Today this original recipe has evolved in many variations to include using chicken, seafood and much more. The Geneva 11 Piece Fondue Set is a modern design with a mirrored stainless steel finish. The set includes; fondue pot, splatter guard, 6 numbered stainless steel forks, 18/8 stainless steel burner, stainless steel rechaud and bamboo base plate. FONDUE TIPS A fondue pot cooks meat quickly, so a tender cut of meat—like beef tenderloin—is recommended. Fondue Bourguignon - individual diners dunk chunks of skewered meat into sizzling vegetable oil and then dip the cooked pieces into savory sauces. More health-conscious selections are fish, shrimp, chicken and vegetables in a broth instead of oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619eoZ54uqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swissmar","source_asin":"B00E397JNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E397JNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E397JNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727045,"name":"Christmas Blanket for Couch/Bed/Sofa Red Buffalo Plaid Blankets & Throws Truck Fuzzy Fleece Blanket Soft Cozy Blanket for Adult Lightweight Flannel Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ShSl8FVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❣ MULTIPLE THROW BLANKET SIZE--Kids size-40x50inch/Throw size-50x60inch/Twin size-60x80inch,a variety of blanket sizes for your choice,Kids size blanket suitable for newborns and toddlers,can be used as a baby receiving blanket,Throw size blanket suitable for teen,can be used as a bedding,Twin size blanket suitable for adults/women/men.You can easily choose a blanket suitable for your home decor. ❣HIGH-QUALITY FLANNEL BLANKET--The fuzzy blanket is made of premium flannel fleece soft and comfortable without pilling and shedding,warmer and more skin-friendly than polyester material,Tightly stitched edges and strong seams make your warm blanket more durable than cheap sew blankets.Besides lightweight & easy to carry,perfect as a travel blanket,or camping blanket,to help you keep out the cold. ❣ MULTI-PURPOSE--Our cozy blankets have a good balance of practicality and decoration.It can be used as a throw blanket for couch/bed/sofa,or office while watching TV,or present of lap blankets for the elderly.The warm blanket is also a great choice for mothers to use as blankets for baby boys and girls.Besides,A throw blanket with a delicate print can decorative accent for our room.If you use it as a pet blanket,your pet will like it. ❣ GREAT HOLIDAY GIFT--If you're still thinking about gifts for winter,choose our throw blankets and share the warmth with your family,friends,or loved ones during the cold winter months.Our blankets are perfect for birthdays,anniversaries,housewarmings,Christmas,Halloween,and Thanksgiving,and also as holiday decorations to add a chic ambiance to a room. ❣ EASY CARE--Machine wash with cold water,gently cycle separately and tumble dry low,no bleach.Do not dry clean.The colors displayed under different lights,display settings,or resolutions,will be slightly different.Our throw is great for all seasons,available for both indoor and outdoor use,If you don't use it for a while,please roll it up for storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ShSl8FVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Little Beauty","source_asin":"B0BHRS15C2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHRS15C2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHRS15C2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
