window.products.push({"id":727236,"name":"Red, Green & White Painted Brown Albasia Wood Sea Turtle with Baby Figurine Statue for Home Décor - Handmade by Bali Artisans - 8-1/4\" x 5-1/2\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vUAcwmyDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DESIGNER STYLING - This elegant statue by Sarda showcases a sea turtle with a small turtle baby on its back. The bodies feature hand-carved textures that add visual interest to the piece. The shelled reptiles are hand-painted with accents of green, yellow, red, and brown. The figurine is hand-carved from albasia wood sourced from Indonesia, which is known for being durable and sustainable. This handcrafted figurine adds unique flair to your home decor. A STYLISH TOUCH – Meticulously hand-carved and handcrafted premium materials are the focus of every unique decorative item by Sarda Lifestyle. All of our creations are made with love by expert artisans in Bali, Indonesia. These tasteful housewares were designed by Janyl Adair with both form and function in mind. They harmonize perfectly with any decor, adding an updated, organic flair to your space. Choose these eye-catching items to add a unique look to your home or office. THE HIGHEST STANDARDS – Each gorgeous, collector-quality piece in our Amazon collection has been fashioned by a team of Balinese craftspeople with decades of dedication to Sarda’s brand. When you open the box and hold your new treasure, you’ll be impressed by the quality feel. Sarda designs are substantial, made with high-quality materials like striking shells and sturdy, sustainable wood. The beautiful detail and fine workmanship are as impressive up close as from a distance. AN IMPRESSIVE GIFT – Looking for a birthday or Mother’s Day gift idea for your mom, daughter, sister, granddaughter, or best friend? Sarda jewelry is on-trend and sure to delight. Packaged in a signature presentation box, it’s ready for giving – the perfect surprise for your wife or girlfriend for an anniversary or Valentine’s Day. Or treat yourself with our exotic designs and be dressed to impress for a girl’s night out, party, date, holiday celebration, wedding, or any special event. YOUR DELIGHT 100% GUARANTEED – At Sarda, our prime purpose is to provide the utmost customer service. To keep this standard, Sarda inspects each and every one of our products to make sure you are getting the very best! If for any reason you aren’t totally delighted, we’re pleased to offer a No-Questions-Asked Money-Back Guarantee for 90 days after purchase. We stand behind our products; if you ever encounter a problem with a Sarda piece, please reach out to us and let us know!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vUAcwmyDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SARDA","source_asin":"B09HSFWDFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HSFWDFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HSFWDFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
