window.products.push({"id":727250,"name":"Furrion F1S21L03A-BL, 21\", Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y29Gl-a0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"2-In-1: Cook, bake, fry, and grill in your RV kitchen, while on the road, with this combined cooktop range and oven. Works with propane power or gas power. It provides up to 8000 BTU power output from the 3-burner cooktop and 7,100 BTU from the oven burner. Large Capacity & Sleek Design: Boasting one of the largest capacities in the industry, with an inner volume of 1.79 cu. ft. / 50.79L, home cooking on the road has never been easier. Design features include a brushed stainless steel finish, layered glass door, glass cover, cavity lighting, and LED knobs. Easy To Clean: Wired grate and enamel tray fit over the top of the burners and lift off for easy cleaning. The range oven features a broiler pan with an insert to catch dripping fat while the hinged glass cover protects the cooktop and acts as a backsplash. Durable & Made For The Road: The oven is constructed with durable, stainless-steel design that is vibration and corrosion resistant. The 3-layer glass on the oven door prevents any damage from the heat, and the grate fits into rubber holes in the tray to prevent rattling while in motion. ANSI Z21.57a Recreational Vehicle Cooking certified, and CAN1-1.16-M79 Propane Fired Cooking Appliances for Recreational Vehicles certified. Built for Safety: The safety cutoff valve prevents fire hazards while peizo ignition makes it safe & easy to light burners. The brushed, stainless steel construction resists vibration and extreme temperatures. Top glass cover protects burners while extending the workspace when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y29Gl-a0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furrion","source_asin":"B08XY46HMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XY46HMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XY46HMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
