window.products.push({"id":727271,"name":"Under Sliding Cabinet Basket Organizer, Under Sink Organizer, 2 Tier Bathroom Organizer Under Sink, Sliding Cabinet Basket Organizer Drawers with Hook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61smdSx6zKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 Tier Under Sink Storage Organizer】 Both the double-layer storage boxes can be pushed and pulled, so you don't need to worry about the items being too difficult to take out. You don't need to bend down into the sink cabinet, just pull out the storage box and get the items you want immediately. Double-layer storage makes better use of space and effectively solves the storage problem of narrow space. 【Stable Structured Storage with Hooks & Bucket】This under-sink storage box is made of high quality ABS plastic and rust-proof support tube. It has a stable structure and can hold heavy bathroom items without shaking. It has enough space for household items. The 2 Tier Bathroom Organizer comes with 4 extra hooks and 1 storage bucket that you can use to hang small items like towels, bath balls, etc., to make the most of the limited space. 【Quick Assembly + Reasonable Size】This slide-out 2 Tier Bathroom Organizer is 39.5 * 37.5 * 20cm / 15.6in * 14.8in * 7.9in. With perfect storage for most bathroom supplies, kitchen, tabletop, etc., it provides more possibilities for your home storage and saves you a lot of space. Also, this is easy to install, no tools are required, and it can be installed quickly in just a few minutes. 【Easy to Clean】The 2 Tier Bathroom Organizer Under Sink adopts a hollow design, which has a good drainage effect. It can be cleaned by simply wiping the surface with the cloth, saving time and effort. Removable dividers allow for better separation of items. Keep your cabinets neater and more organized. Designed with a ball bearing system, it slides out very smoothly and quietly. You have get everything within easy reach, perfect for your kitchen, bathroom and pantry. 【Wide Application】Double-layer design, can store your items to the greatest extent, without worrying about messiness. Can be used as under sink storage, bathroom storage, kitchen storage, tabletop cosmetic storage rack and more. Ideal for bathrooms, kitchens, living rooms, offices and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61smdSx6zKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POWSTRO K","source_asin":"B0BCFYLJNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCFYLJNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCFYLJNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
