window.products.push({"id":727364,"name":"Neucox Silent Alarm Clock Battery Powered Little Small Clock Bedroom Clock Analog Alarm Clocks Non Ticking with Snooze Light Simple Clocks for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DvwVSo9EL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"★ SILENT CLOCK WITH UPGRADED MOVEMENT. The bedroom alarm clock uses a high-quality movement, and the pointer scans quietly without making noise to disturb your sleep, study or work in your daily life. It make you completely immersed in your sweet dream for a whole night. So you can put this desk clock on your bedside table, kitchen, living room. ★ NIGHT LIGHT ALARM CLOCK. The table clock is easy to read time. When you want to check the time at night, you only need to press the SNOOZE/LIGHT button of the alarm clock, and it will emit a soft yellow light to protect your eyes and make it easier for you to see the numbers of the alarm clock. ★ CRESCENDO ALARM WITH REPEATING SNOOZE. The alarm is loud and gradually beeps louder in volume to wake you up. Press the snooze button on top for another 5 minutes sleep and snooze repeats every 5 minutes until you turn the alarm off. ★ ANALOG CLOCK WITH LARGE DISPLAY AND PRECISE TIME. Big numbers on dial is easy to read even across the room. Durable battery alarm clock that shows time accurately. It won’t lose time even after a long period of work. ★ SIMPLE COMPACT DESIGN WITH GOOD DECORATION. Even no need instructions to operate it, clearly marked, this one has only 3 buttons. It fits easily into a suitcase even your pocket during your journey. This clock is operated by 1*AA battery(Not included). Great gift for Fathers, Mothers, Elderly, Children, Kids, Girls. An excellent gift idea for Birthdays, Housewarmings and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DvwVSo9EL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neucox","source_asin":"B09LLTMFRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LLTMFRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LLTMFRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727365,"name":"Fresno California Skyline by Michael Tompsett, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KFtqE1IYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor skyline of Fresno, California. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KFtqE1IYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NGZU9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NGZU9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NGZU9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
