window.products.push({"id":727556,"name":"MTOMDY Tree of Life Peridot & Tiger Eye Crystal Pyramid Energy Generator Stone, for Meditation, Yoga, Spiritual Balance, Suitable for Home Decoration ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710OfNfl+SL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Crystal Stone The diameter of the Orgonite pyramid is approximately. 2.36 x 2.36 inches, the height is approximately 2.63 inches. Handmade Orgone Pyramid: It is made of peridot, tiger's eye, resin, and copper wire. The exterior of this handmade stone pyramid is a resin model, and the interior is a luxuriant hand-wrapped olivine gem money tree. The Pyramid of Orgone, the tree of life: The meaning of the tree of life is a symbol of spirit. Its branches stretch to the sky and its roots are deeply rooted in the ground. The tree of life represents the connection between heaven and earth and between eternal life, reflecting the symbolism. Many aspects of life. Pyramid energy generator: The Pyramid of Peridot and Orgone can collect and purify the energy in the universe, and then emit it. Olivine is the stone of wealth, and wrapping the olivine money tree in the pyramid will help you attract more positive energy and wealth. Feng Shui Decoration: The gem pyramid is an excellent decoration choice for your office, home, dining table, desk, etc. It can reduce the negative energy generated by computers, TVs and other household appliances on the human body. In addition, put it in your yoga room to help you calm down and find your inner peace when you do yoga. You will feel its balance and coordinate your body's energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710OfNfl+SL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MTOMDY","source_asin":"B095228TKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095228TKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095228TKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727557,"name":"Bodum Eileen 3-Piece Coffee Press Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4106SP5V3AL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Take advantage of this fantastic savings. You can purchase the industrial strength Eileen French press with two matching cups together and save 50% off of the normal price. The Eileen 8 Cup Coffee Press was designed in honor of Eileen Gray, a famous art deco designer. With it's sturdy frame and easy grip santoprene handle, the Eileen makes a beautiful presentation, while being durable enough for use in restaurants and cafes. Brewing coffee in a French press is easy. Just add coarse ground coffee, fill with hot water and give it a little stir, then place the lid and plunger on the pot. After 4 minutes, press and enjoy. The benefit of the French press is that you get the best possible extraction of the essential oils and acids from the coffee, giving you a balanced and flavorful brew every time. The Eileen 8 Cup is a 32 ounce coffee press and will yield 8 - 4 oz cups of coffee. Amazon.com Bodum designed the Eileen coffee press with professionals in mind, giving it a tougher, sturdier frame to withstand the rigors of café service while still delivering the same rich, full flavors for which press coffee is known. And if it's tough enough for café service, it will excel when used in the home. The Eileen was conceived in tribute to the art deco designer Eileen Gray, and features an intertwined stainless-steel frame that encases the glass carafe without hiding it. The frame, with its alternating parallel lines, also complements the design of the two included 10-ounce cups--an ideal size for a hearty coffee. The frame also offers the advantage of durability, as it withstands the inevitable knocks and bumps that restaurants and cafés bestow upon their equipment. Other features include a santoprene-coated square handle that grips securely in the hand and a secure lid that keeps the coffee safely inside. And, true to the tradition of press pots, the Eileen makes fuller-bodied coffee than other brewing methods, steeping the coarsely ground coffee for four to five minutes before serving. The 32-ounce press pot yields eight 4-ounce cups of coffee or four 8-ounce cups, and the entire set is dishwasher-safe. --Rivers Janssen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4106SP5V3AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B0000U6PSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000U6PSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000U6PSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
