window.products.push({"id":727582,"name":"THE FRESHGLOW Co FRESHPAPER Food Saver Sheets for Cheese, 8 Reusable Sheets (1 Pack), Keeps Cheese Fresh for 2-4x Longer- Made in the USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vNMHyoEqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The best way to jump start a healthy lifestyle is by adding more fresh ingredients to your routine! It can seem impossible sometimes but FRESHPAPER is the simple, earth-friendly & economical tool to help you get there! Just use FRESHPAPER Cheese-Saver wraps with any hard or semi-soft cheese and store in fridge. Our natural food saver sheets are infused with organic, active botanicals that keep food fresh for up to 2–4 times longer. Eight (8) reusable FRESHPAPER Cheese-Saver wraps (1 pack) equals approximately a two month's supply. FRESHPAPER will pay for itself, reduce costly food waste, reduce single-use plastic waste, and help you reach your healthy lifestyle goals! By harnessing the power of active botanicals, natural materials, and simple design, FRESHGLOW Co. innovations make life a little bit easier and a lot more inspired. Our sheets are biodegradable, compostable, and recyclable, so you won't have to worry about product waste once a sheet reaches the end of its lifetime. Join The Movement! When FRESHGLOW Co.'s founder Kavita invented FRESHPAPER as part of her middle-school science project, she never imagined that her simple innovation would one day be used by farmers and families around the world, and have a chance to change the food system. Join us, as we take on global food waste, starting in your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vNMHyoEqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE FRESHGLOW CO","source_asin":"B0B5JNLSRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5JNLSRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5JNLSRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
