window.products.push({"id":727587,"name":"Bag-Caddy Portable Garbage/Storage Bag Frame Collegiate Collection, Auburn University Tigers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41d6tcbPZZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Whether you are tailgating, grilling or any time you want to display your team colors grab a bag, grab a Bag-Caddy and show your pride. The Custom Quest Bag-Caddy is a portable support device that works together with any plastic garbage bag to create a freestanding, easy-to-use receptacle. Perfect for tailgating, picnics, parties, recycling, yard work, camping, patios, and more. Any time you use a bag the Bag-Caddy can help you do more, easier, with less effort. To use, just unroll it, drop a bag in, lock the bag open with the 4 die-cut tabs, and load it up. When you're done just unlock the tabs, tie up the bag, slide the Bag-Caddy over the top, and roll it up. Now your full bag is upright, flat bottomed, and easy to manage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41d6tcbPZZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Custom Quest","source_asin":"B00CSY8REC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CSY8REC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CSY8REC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
