window.products.push({"id":727592,"name":"Kibbidea Kids Knife for Real Cooking, BPA Free Kids Safe Kitchen Knife, Rounded Tip, Stainless Steel Kids' Baking Supplies for Cutting Fruits Veggies ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxyXnKioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Safe Kids Knife for Real Cooking - Kibbidea kids chef knives have blunt tips and serrated edges, which will not scratch skins. The ergonomic handle provides a secure, comfortable grip, helping unleash your little angel’s culinary skills and providing them with security. We also have a finger guard for each knife, which can also keep the fingers safe while slicing. Efficient in Food Cutting - Kibbidea Kids-friendly knives are lightweight and easy to handle. The serrated teeth will grab the food more easily and is less likely to slip. It's easy for kids to slice and dice cake, cheese and many types of fruits and veggies like apples, cucumbers and butter lettuce with the chef knife. Food-Grade Material - Kibbidea kids knife is made to be safe with food-grade stainless steel, BPA-free, and contains no harmful materials. They are heat-resistant, safer and healthier than other kids knives. Support Growing Independence - Allowing your little one to participate in preparing meals helps grow their confidence. Kibbidea chef knives are 100% safe for children, even toddlers can use them to safely cut food in the kitchen. Best Gift for the Little Chef - Having a quality and safe chef knife means having less stress and more fun in the kitchen. Kibbidea chef knives is a great choice for every little chef. Our knife sets are individually hand-selected for quality and durability. The stainless steel blade is easy to maintain, hand wash, and air dry are recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxyXnKioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kibbidea","source_asin":"B0C7M651R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7M651R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7M651R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
