window.products.push({"id":727682,"name":"Colourworks 1 x Kitchen Craft CWGRABDISP24 Silicone Splatter Screen 28cm Blue, Hang Tagged","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dkAia72sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Kitchen Craft Colourworks Blue Silicone Splatter Screen provides the perfect barrier against hot spatters of oil, fat and boiling water from pans and woks. Whether you’re frying burgers in a griddle pan or boiling vegetables in a saucepan, it prevents stovetops and work surfaces from becoming marked, as well as protecting you from burns. It’s heat resistant to temperatures as high as 260 degrees Celsius / 500 degrees Fahrenheit, so it can cope with anything cooking related! This silicone splatter screen is perforated, so steam escapes safely, without a sudden surge as you uncover the pan. Made from silicone it’s very easy to keep clean. Lots of materials stain and absorb odours with use. Silicone doesn’t. So, you can fry anything from pans of fish, liver and onions to eggs – whether you hand wash it in warm water or pop it in your dishwasher, all the odours and stains wash away.With a sturdy and rigid stainless steel shank, the handle is also coated in heat resistant silicone, so the handle remains safe to touch whilst in use. It is also non-slip, easy grip so when you do pick it up, it offers a safe, secure grip. There is also an integrated hanging loop, so you can conveniently hang it up in your kitchen or pantry, rather than wrestling with it in a drawer. It’s also very versatile. The Colourworks Blue Silicone Splatter Screen can also be used for sifting, steaming and straining – thanks to its flat, perforated surface. And, what’s more, it comes with a five year guarantee! Combine your blue silicone splatter screen with a variety of blue silicone kitchen tools and accessories for complete coordination. Or experiment with the 10 other gorgeous tones, also available from the Kitchen Craft Colourworks range. About Colourworks The perfect blend of vibrancy and practicality, the Colourworks range by Kitchen Craft features more than 400 essential kitchen tools, gadgets, knives and accessories in 11 vibrant colours. Don't let the fun colours fool you, this is seriously high performance kitchen kit, designed to deliver incredible reliability on a daily basis. Using a variety of materials across the whole collection, including flexible LFGB grade, food-safe silicone, strong stainless steel, virtually unbreakable melamine and durable nylon, each product in our range provides fantastic performance whatever the cooking task. Set Contains: Splatter Screen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dkAia72sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Colourworks","source_asin":"B0BDKYGDPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDKYGDPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDKYGDPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
