window.products.push({"id":727773,"name":"Ergocar Posture Therapy Memory Neck Pillow - Ergonomic Back Support Pillow for Home, Office, Car, Travel - Relieve & Prevent Upper & Lower Back Pain (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Nt2zuRxLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The back plays a major role in your health and well-being. Chronic back pain is among the top two causes of long-term disability, and lower back pain a leading factor in lost time at work. Chronic back pain affects one in every 10 people, often so debilitating that it interferes with sufferers’ daily lives, severely restricting normal activities. Back pain in the workplace is common, with nearly all workers struggling with back pain and discomfort at some point. On average, adults spend 11.5 hours daily sitting. Healthy Is Priceless！ Buy Ergocar Lumbar Cushion&Neck Support Kit Would Be Definitely One Of The Best Investments You'Ve Ever Made !We Aiming At Better Your Life. High Quality Memory Form : 100% Brand New with superior high quality. Ergocar lumbar pillows adopt high grade malleable memory foam, not easy to deform. Ergonomic Design : The shape of lumbar cushions fit for our spine curve perfectly to your back for maximum comfort & support.Use this pillow as a posture corrector to help with alignment and relieve pressure while driving your car or sitting on your office chair at work. 50D SLOW REBOUND MEMORY FOAM PADDING： Our memory foam is 100% pure with no additives and is made of the exact same material as the world's leading memory foam manufacturers. Can be used to improve bad posture and relieve leg pain while driving or sitting for long periods, like a wheelchair. We Always Support High Quality Products And Services. If You Are Not Satisfied With Any Of Our Products, Please Contact Us, We Will Provide You With Friendly Support And Service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Nt2zuRxLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergocar","source_asin":"B07JLMGG6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JLMGG6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JLMGG6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
