window.products.push({"id":727833,"name":"Indo Fire Brick Tab Top Sari Sheer Curtain (43 in. x 84 in.) with Matching tieback","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71otKomtqnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Add splendor to any room in your home with these rod pocket sari sheer curtains from India. These handmade drapes are heavily bordered with excellent artworkSari Curtains / Drapes / Panels are the perfect choice for those looking for light, elegant drapes with a touch of luxury. It has smooth finish with a soft sheen and feels gentle and cool to the touch. Sheer curtains made of saris allow light in through windows but prevent people looking in when they are drawn. Story Behind the Art:The fabric of these curtains are weaved on a hand-loom in a small rural village in India and then hand-dyed. The artisans are a group of young hand-crafters who have moved from small villages to a big town in Central India and make various home decor items out of these exotic sari fabrics. This gives these wonderful artisans a way to have sustainable income via selling to the worldwide market on the internet. Your purchase supports local and home-based work where the artisans can easily tend to their families and pass these time-honored skills from one generation to the next.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71otKomtqnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indian Selections","source_asin":"B00DNPT1OU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DNPT1OU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DNPT1OU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
