window.products.push({"id":727857,"name":"GLIDESTORE 3-Piece Airlock for Fermentation with Silicone Grommets, Airlocks Kit for Preserving, Brewing, Making Wine, Fermenting Sauerkraut, Kimchi (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sSyPnYt-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What Is The 3-piece Airlocks? ① Our 3-piece airlock is made of plastic. It includes the body, piston and vented cap. ② Airlocks are used to seal up the carton. The airlock kit prevents air from getting out of the carboy and allows carbon dioxine to escape during fermentation. How do you use the three-piece airlock for fermentation? Ⓐ Remove the cap and the protective foam insert. Discard the insert. Fill the inside of the airlock 1/2 way with water. Ⓑ Put the cap back on and insert the tip of the airlock with silicone grommet into the lid. Make sure it seals up the bottle tightly. Ⓒ Gas is released during fermentation. You will see bubbles forming and escaping through water in the airlock. Ⓓ The airlock kit prevents oxygen from entering the carboy since oxygen will ruin the fermentation. Ⓔ Sometimes, remove the airlock to let the fermentation burp. Check on your fermentation and release pressure (This step may not be required. It depends on your project) Package Including: 4* Airlock for Fermentation 8* Silicone Black Grommets From GLIDESDTORE GROUP - Committed to bringing durable, high-quality products to make our customers to make everyday life easier. ✅ For any reason IF you are not satisfied with the Airlock for Fermentation, we offer: 👉 MONEY BACK GUARANTEE WITHIN 60 DAYS 👉 FULL REFUND or GET A REPLACEMENT immediately  ✨ Because your satisfaction is our top priority. ✨ Don’t Wait Another Day! => ADD TO CART & BUY NOW WITH CONFIDENCE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sSyPnYt-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLIDESTORE","source_asin":"B07PLD36F7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PLD36F7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PLD36F7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
