window.products.push({"id":727859,"name":"OQUYDEA Sparkling Glass Magnets - 12 Pcs Crystal Strong Fridge Magnets for Office, Whiteboard, Cabinet and Dishwasher Decoration… (Gold and Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iH0G2S4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing our sparkling round refrigerator magnets. These magnets are perfect for adding some personality to your fridge while also holding important notes and reminders in place. 【Easy and safe】Crystal Glass Refrigerator Magnets measures 1.2''* 1.2''(30MM), round semi-curved polished crystal fridge sticker. They are easy to handle and their smooth, rounded edges make them safe to use around kids and pets. It’s perfect to use them to hold up photos, shopping lists, or your child's artwork. 【Great for organization】Whether you need to keep track of important dates, grocery lists, or your favorite recipes, our magnets make it easy to stay organized. They're strong enough to hold multiple sheets of paper at once, so you can keep all your important information in one place. 【Durable and gentle】These refrigerator magnets are made of durable glass and soft rubber magnets, it will not scratch any surface. They won't crack, fade, or lose their magnetism over time, ensuring that they'll stay looking great and holding strong for years to come. 【Fun and glamorous】Our magnets are designed to add a fun and playful touch to any space. The glittery, shiny finish and vibrant colors are sure to catch the eye and bring a smile to your face. Add a touch of sparkle and glamour to your kitchen or office with these beautiful glass circle fridge magnets. 【Versatile magnetic use】These magnets aren't just for fridges! They can also be used on any magnetic surface, such as metal cabinets or bulletin boards. This makes them a versatile addition to your home or office. 【Perfect for gifts】Our sparkling round refrigerator magnets make a great gift for friends, family, or anyone who loves to add a pop of color to their space. They're also a great choice for stocking stuffers, party favors, or gift baskets. If you have any questions about your fridge magnet after it arrives, please feel free to contact us via Amazon email. We’re dedicated to providing excellent customer service and will respond to your inquiry within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iH0G2S4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OQUYDEA","source_asin":"B0BXGH8G2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXGH8G2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXGH8G2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
