window.products.push({"id":727891,"name":"Teak Wood Cutting Board with Juice Groove (EXTRA-Thick: 18 x 12 x 2) Channels, The Gala","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yF-IE+TVL._AC_SL1201_.jpg","description":"Teak Wood Cutting Board with Juice Groove (EXTRA-Thick: 18 x 12 x 2) Carving Board with Juice Channels, The Gala This elegant premium grade Indonesian teak wood cutting board comes with built-in juice grooves, small indents in the board which stop excess liquid from spilling onto your counter when you cut things. Whether you’re cutting meats, vegetables, or fruits, the wood chopping block with the juice groove will keep it all on your counter so you can focus more on preparing food, and less on clean up. With our large 18'' x 12'' frame, the TeakCraft butcher block is large enough to cut anything and everything you’d want to cut such as chopping meats, vegetables, breads , while also fitting nicely into your kitchen. The large end-grain butcher block is made of sustainably grown edge-grain teak wood, which makes it look beautiful and gives it many advantages over other butcher blocks. Teak wood is naturally waterproof due to the oils inside of the wood, meaning that the wood cutting board with juice groove will be able to last as long as you need it. Complying with these easy steps will ensure longevity for your solid chopping board. Cleansing: ● Keep your butcher block tidy by washing with soap and water after each usage. ● Make sure to rinse off all residue soap. ● Pad all the water down with a towel until the cutting board is completely dry. Preserving: ● Use a small drop of food-grade mineral oil. ● Make sure to use food quality mineral oil - no veggie oils Care: ● Do not use in the microwave or stove. Do not clean in the dishwasher. Hand Wash only. ● Do not position warm pots or mugs on top of the surface of the bamboo wood cutting board, as this can leave scorch marks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yF-IE+TVL._AC_SL1201_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeakCraft","source_asin":"B08132C5SH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08132C5SH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08132C5SH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727892,"name":"Homedant 5-Tier Laminated Metal Shelving Unit Adjustable Garage Storage Utility Rack Heavy Duty Shelves Organization Multipurpose Shelf Warehouse Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817KqcPVzEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【 Superior Upgrade Laminated Board 】: Say goodbye to worrying about water damage and humidity and flimsy shelves that warp or split. This is not only designed with a much thicker laminated board for durability to withstand water damage and can be used in areas with high humidity but also looks great and feels soft to the touch. Plus, it's easy to manage - if any contaminants get on the surface, simply remove them without any pesky stains or seepage. 🟧【 MULTIPURPOSE STORAGE SOLUTION 】 : this shelving unit offers a useful transformation. With the post connector, it can be easily turned into two shorter units that serve as a table, workbench, or corner shelf, or stacked up to create tall shelving for using storage space efficient. It's the perfect solution for those who need to make the most of their limited space without sacrificing efficiency. Don't settle for a basic shelf when you can have a multi-functional storage solution. 🟧【 EASY TO ASSEMBLE 】 : No more hiring someone to assemble your shelves for you. With our product, you can assemble it yourself in just 10 minutes without any bolts or nuts. Simply slide and fix the frame into the post hole by lightly pressing it. It's so easy, you can even do it with your bare hands! And if you do need a tool, a rubber hammer is all you need (not included). 🟧【 HEAVY DUTY & STURDY 】 : This 5-tier steel shelving unit is made of high-quality premium steel and Laminated boards from Korea, of which maximum load is 264 lb per shelf (equal distribution). 🟧【 ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT 】 : Each tier can be adjusted up and down by 1.18 inches, so you can easily adjust up or down to accommodate your need and store items of different sizes. Adjustable height is an essential part of any storage system, and it is the perfect choice for creating functional storage space. 🟧【 VERSATILE SHELF STYLES 】 : With this shelving unit, you're not limited to just one style. Customize it to your heart's content with options like an open-style basic shelf, a shelf with raised edges to prevent items from falling off, or a mixed format shelf for easy access. Whatever your needs may be, this shelf can adapt and create the perfect storage solution for you. For more information and inspiration, check out the video above! 🟧【 THICKER & STRONG BOARD 】 : It is made of high-quality 0.36\" thick boards from Korea, and it is much denser than others and is therefore much stronger and more durable. So it is less susceptible to warping and cupping, making it an ideal choice for heavy duty. 🟧【SMOOTH FINISHING TOUCHES, RUST & SCRATCH PROOF 】 : ① The surface is covered with a premium powder coating that is not only thick but also free of toxic six heavy metals. This not only gives it a clean and polished look but also makes it resistant to rust and scratches. ② This unit comes with sixteen post-caps, which are essential for protecting your floor from getting scratched or damaged during the assembly process. With these finishing touches, you can be sure that your shelving unit will not only look great but also maintain its quality over time. 🟧【 UNIQUE PERK OF HOMEDANT 】: As a thank you for your purchase, we're including a special gift 🎁 of J-Hook, Post Fixing Clip, and Wall Fixing Bracket. We hope you'll find these useful in your organization endeavors and appreciate your loyalty to our brand. 🟧【 PROVIDE ASSEMBLE VIDEO AND PDF FILE 】 : Provides assembly manual & videos to help you understand easier. You can see the assembly video at the top images or download the Installation Manual in \"Product guides and documents\" at the bottom of the product description.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817KqcPVzEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEDANT","source_asin":"B08R8GPF7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R8GPF7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R8GPF7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727893,"name":"BELLEZE Lighted Corner Display Curio Cabinet Wooden Shelving Unit with Tempered Glass Door, Bar and Liquor Storage Area with 6 Shelves - Woody (Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mhIROVFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[CLASSIC STYLE] This China cabinet is a classic piece, updated with sleek lines for a modern feel. [AMPLE STORAGE] Six shelves allow for plenty of storage space. Use the piece traditionally to store wine and dishes, or repurpose it as a trophy case. [WELL-LIT SPACE] A top-mounted light and mirrored back panels ensure that all of your valuable items are beautifully displayed and easy to view. One lightbulb included. [SLIM, SPACE-SAVING SHAPE] This tall, slender piece measures 72\"H x 26\"W x 13\"D. Glass shelf thickness: 0.19\". Each shelf holds up to 15 lbs. [LOVE-IT OR 100 DAY RETURNS] We guarantee that you'll love this product. If not, simply return within 100 days of purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mhIROVFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLEZE","source_asin":"B09DYH2F29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYH2F29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYH2F29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
