window.products.push({"id":727924,"name":"KORO Japanese Nakiri Knife - Razor Sharp Traditional Honbazuke Honed AUS10 Japanese High Carbon Steel - Hand Brushed - Natural Mkuruti Wood Octagonal ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819aoa88iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Using Authentic Japanese AUS-10 Stainless Steel, this unique blade has the perfect mix of anti corrosive properties and blade hardness to give it a long lasting scary sharp edge. At Rockwell hardness 60 the metal is extremely hard, AUS-10 has many other well regarded properties one being that on sharpening it finds an edge easily. Given that it is such a hard long lasting edge this resharpening property makes it stand out. The brushed finish releases the cutting from the blade making it an efficient tool in a busy kicten. Every detail has been improved, the reinforced bolster will ensure the blade handle connections longevity and keeping with tradition the beautiful crafted octagonal handle has proven its grip and comfort lasting the test of time. We have held to tradition creating a 'true 7 inch Nakiri\" premium knife. Beautiful presented in a gold magnetic gift box, this knife will be a favourite and a conversation started in your kicten.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819aoa88iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KoroK","source_asin":"B0BNCJ1GXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNCJ1GXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNCJ1GXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727925,"name":"Corelle Square Vitrelle 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4, Autumn Berries","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xd1x1v2IS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant and modern with a practical everyday construction, Autumn Berries dinnerware from Corelle lets you dress up the table without worry or extra work. Stylish and straightforward, the pattern features layers of branches, leaves, and berry clusters in red, orange, and chocolate on a white background. The look is fashionable yet lasting, simple yet expressive. Completing the design, the pieces’ silhouettes combine straight sides and rounded corners for a softly squared overall effect that is fresh and appealing. Like the rest of the popular Square collection, Autumn Berries dishes are made from Vitrelle laminated glass for the imperviousness to chips and fading that Corelle is known for. The mugs are fashioned from porcelain. All pieces are safe in the microwave, the oven, and the freezer. This 16-piece Autumn Berries set readies the table for four diners. Each place setting includes a 10-1/4-inch dinner plate, an 8-3/4-inch luncheon/salad plate, a 22-ounce soup/cereal bowl, and a 12-ounce mug. Designed for easy stacking and made to clean up in the dishwasher, the set is perfect for daily dining and rises to the occasion for casual entertaining. Corelle includes a 3-year warranty against chips and breakage with normal use. What’s in the Box 4 place settings. Place setting includes: dinner plate; luncheon/salad plate; soup/cereal bowl; mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xd1x1v2IS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B001DHECM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001DHECM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001DHECM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727926,"name":"New York Candle and Company Unscented Candles Set, Tealight, White 125 ct","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xT+6hrHQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Package of 120 clean burning unscented Tealight candles in a self-standing aluminum tin. With these quality Tealights you can enjoy the warm glow of a fine candle while enjoying the maximum safety of the tea light candle. If you’re a restaurant, party planner or just enjoy dining to the romantic touch of tealites, these quality long burning boughies (in French) will deliver the ultimate and lasting radiation of warmth. Made with a special technique to prevent early burn out of your TeaLights. Tea Lights are an efficient and inexpensive, cost effective form of candle lighting for your ritual and religious ceremonies and Holidays. Universal size of ½” tall x 1.5” diameter. Burns nice and clean to the last drop for about 4 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xT+6hrHQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New York Candle and Company","source_asin":"B00PV58P74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PV58P74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PV58P74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":727927,"name":"In the Breeze 8000 Red Bandana 30 Inch x 72 Inch Fitted Tablecloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YKxe0B81L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don't mess with another tablecloth blowing away while enjoying the great outdoors! With the In the Breeze six and eight foot Fitted Tablecloths you can be sure your tablecloth will stay secure and in place. Each corner has an elastic band (like a fitted sheet) and a deep four inch pocket so that this tablecloth will fit many table depths. Perfect for the six or eight foot plastic folding table you already own but they also work great at park or camping site tables! Those big, heavy cement or wood ones. Our tablecloths have a special stain and water resistant coating added so that wiping up spills is a breeze! Best part is, it's machine washable and dryable, made of a polyester fabric not vinyl! Durable and fade resistant, these unique tablecloths will be great at your next picnic, camping trip, backyard BBQ, any other outdoor, or in, use. The tablecloths come in two sizes, 30 inch by 72 inch (2. 5 foot by 6 foot) and 36 inch by 96 inch (3 foot by 8 foot). There are also six different designs to choose from. Red Bandana, Happy Hour, Plaid, Rainbow, Rustic Camping and Tropical. Find something for yourself and then pick one out for a friend! In the Breeze is a family run, US company, based in Central Oregon. We have been a leader in manufacturing outdoor fabric decorative products, kinetic spinners and kites for over 30 years! We take pride in our award winning designs. Our product development team pays attention to every detail, using the best fabric compositions, color trends, printing techniques, sewing and embroidery applications. In addition, we are using innovative connectors, fiberglass, string, swivels, adherents and findings. Every step of the way we are involved in the process and design of each unique item. In the Breeze stands behind every product we make. If you have any questions or concerns don't hesitate to contact us. In the Breeze believes that color processing and motion stimuli are essential to both adults and children. Get outside with your family and friends and enjoy all that In the Breeze products have to offer. Color our world with color in motion! -The In the Breeze Team","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YKxe0B81L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"In the Breeze","source_asin":"B07PT943DG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PT943DG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PT943DG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
