window.products.push({"id":727940,"name":"Stand By by Moises Levy in White Matte and Black Framed Artwork, 16 by 16\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JhhQueR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a black and white dock with mountains visible in the distance. Born in Mexico City, Moises Levy is a lifelong resident there, and works in the city as an established architect. He has a deep appreciation of the natural relation between light and architecture, and it was this interest in the qualities of light that lead Levy to photography. As a counterpoint to his work as an architect he has now been drawn to landscape work. An 11x11 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x16 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JhhQueR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01M32X7DR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M32X7DR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M32X7DR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
