window.products.push({"id":727995,"name":"YBM Home in Drawer Bamboo Kitchen Knife Storage Block, Knife Organizer and Holder 317","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uswUiCJkL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","description":"Get the big block off your counter-top and keep all your knife collections organized hidden in a drawer with this in-drawer knife block organizer A Knife Organizer for Blade Protection, Organization, and Freeing Up Counter Space This beautiful bamboo knife block is an attractive storage masterpiece that exhibits fine craftsmanship, functionality, and elegance to keep your knives hidden in a drawer and off the counter. Your knives are essential tools that can’t be dispersed into a drawer with other cooking utensils; that action can damage the knives and not to mention getting cut when reaching for them. Our bamboo knife block is an organization statement in which every time you find yourself just opening the drawer, you will enjoy the view of safety accessing and choosing your knives more convenient. Free up some counter space and protect the sharpness of the blade with our in-drawer knife storage solution. Easy Delightful Retrieval The well-constructed carved slots make retrieving your knives easily while retaining the sharpness of the blades unlike bulky knife organizers. Featuring 2-tier design, the lower tier holds 6 knives up to 10” inches in length and 1 sharpening steel, while the top tier holds steak knives,cheese knives, utility, and other types up to 6” inches in length. Great Gift Idea Think of giving this sturdy and attractive bamboo knife block as a gift for Mother’s Day, Thanksgiving, Holidays, and for parents who want to keep dangerous knives out of sight from kids. Specifications - Made of fully matured Moso bamboo - Keeps up to 10-15 knives organized and protected - Measures 17” in L x 8.75” in. W x 2” in. H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uswUiCJkL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YBM HOME","source_asin":"B0BPYVHP9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-727995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPYVHP9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPYVHP9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
